# The go.work workspace is developer-local and must not be tracked: in VCS it
# would mask an unresolved module `require` (e.g. an adapter silently resolving
# core at v0.0.0), which is exactly the release trap the go get smoke test
# guards against. Recreate it locally — see README "Development".
go.work
go.work.sum